 * PTR = `[2][][2]T`) AND dest extras dest-SLICE-of-SLICE extra
 * PTR wrap count (`[][][2]*T` = 1; 0 / missing means no extra
 * PTR = `[][][2]T`) AND dest extras dest-ARRAY of PTR extra
