 * elem_kind (ARRAY vs SLICE vs PTR); discriminant ARRAY vs
 * SLICE vs PTR outer is param kind. dim_ix==ndims+1 returns extra PTR wrap count
 * (`[][2]*T` = 1; `[][2][]*T` = 1 with extra SLICE also in
