 * SLICE also in dims[ndims]; `[2]*[2]*T` = 1;
 * `[2]*[2][]*T` = 1 with extra SLICE also in dims[ndims];
 * `*[2]*T` = 1; `*[2][]*T` = 1 with extra SLICE also in
