 * vs dest extras dest-SLICE of PTR extra `[]*[2]*T` vs dest
 * extras dest-ARRAY of PTR extra `[2]*[2]*T` vs PTR-outer
 * `*[2]*T` vs dest extras dest-ARRAY of SLICE extra wrap
 * `[2][][2][]T` vs dest extras dest-SLICE of SLICE extra wrap
